  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.6: Fixed MessagePack serialization issues in restricted environments like Hangfire background jobs. Added configurable MessagePackResolverStrategy with Conservative (default) and Standard options. Conservative strategy avoids dynamic code generation and works reliably in background job processors. Enhanced error handling with fallback deserialization. Improved compatibility with .NET security restrictions.",
